   "ls": "2.5088px",
   "tt": "uppercase",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "text": "Authentic restoration storytelling with a purpose.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 202,
   "x": 130,
   "font": "\"Playfair Display\", Georgia, serif",
   "size": "99.2px",
   "weight": "700",
   "color": "rgb(245, 240, 232)",
   "lh": "117.056px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "A family-friendly, Route 66-inspired restoration platform for enthusiasts who care about originality, learning, and preserving automotive history.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 736,
   "x": 130,
   "font": "Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
   "size": "17.92px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "rgb(234, 223, 207)",
   "lh": "29.568px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "text": "The Man Behind the Machines",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 1017,
   "x": 696,
   "font": "\"Playfair Display\", Georgia, serif",
   "size": "49.6px",
   "weight": "700",
   "color": "rgb(245, 240, 232)",
   "lh": "58.528px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Fitzgerald Classics exists for the person who wants to understand the why behind every part, finish, tool, and restoration decision. The brand is approachable, knowledgeable, patriotic, and built for long-term trust.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 1176,
   "x": 696,
   "font": "Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "rgb(170, 162, 153)",
   "lh": "26.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Every project should become a useful record: what worked, what failed, which parts were used, which vendors helped, and what another restorer can learn before making the same decision.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 1271,
   "x": 696,
   "font": "Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "rgb(170, 162, 153)",
   "lh": "26.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "ORIGINAL WHERE IT MATTERS.\nDocument the factory details, the deviations, and the reason for every choice.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 1377,
   "x": 696,
   "font": "Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.72)",
   "lh": "26.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "USEFUL TO THE NEXT OWNER.\nKeep the work understandable enough that someone else can learn from it.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 1461,
   "x": 696,
   "font": "Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.72)",
   "lh": "26.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "tt": "none",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "PRESERVE THE STORY.\nTreat each car as history, not just inventory.",
   "region": "main",
   "y": 1545,
   "x": 696,
   "font": "Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.72)",
   "lh": "26.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
